# Shared calc.fdf template for every direction folder. Deliberately left
# with its OWN (wrong-for-this-workflow) MD.TypeOfRun/MD.Steps -- stb
# -optical's own config_extra.fdf (%include'd ahead of this text) must
# override both unconditionally, proving the override actually wins over
# whatever the template itself says (same "prove config_extra.fdf wins"
# convention as stb-gqca/stb-oer's own calc.fdf fixtures).
SystemLabel siesta
%include structure.fdf

PAO.BasisType split
PAO.BasisSize DZP
Mesh.CutOff 200 Ry
XC.functional GGA
XC.authors PBE
Spin non-polarized

MD.TypeOfRun CG
MD.Steps 150
